,"uniiCode":null,"alternateNames":[],"forms":[{"order":1,"ingredientId":106370,"prefix":null,"percent":null,"name":"natural Stevia leaf sweetener","category":"botanical","ingredientGroup":"Stevia","uniiCode":null}]},{"order":10,"ingredientId":76842,"name":"Monk Fruit extract","category":"botanical","ingredientGroup":"Luo Han Guo","uniiCode":null,"alternateNames":[],"forms":[]}]},"pdf":"","percentDvFootnote":"Percent Daily Values are based on a 2,000 calorie diet.","physicalState":{"langualCode":"E0162","langualCodeDescription":"Powder"},"productType":{"langualCode":"A1325","langualCodeDescription":"Other Combinations"},"productVersionCode":"CODE 386524 IRG","servingSizes":[{"order":1,"minQuantity":27.3,"maxQuantity":82,"minDailyServings":1,"maxDailyServings":1,"unit":"Gram(s)","notes":"1-3 scoops","inSFB":true}],"servingsPerContainer":"14","src":"api/label/176044","statements":[{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"30% increase in muscle strength\nWhey Protein + Leucine group\nCarb placebo group\nPercent change\nAn 8-week study of athletes performing an intense resistance exercise training regimen demonstrated that those using this proprietary module of whey protein and leucine had greater increases in muscle strength and size than those on a placebo."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Increases muscle strength and stamina with half the sets\nIn a clinical study using a reduced volume resistance training protocol, the anabolic module in Amplified Wheybolic Extreme 60 Original has been clinically shown to provide the same gains in maximum muscle strength and stamina doing one set while using Amplified Wheybolic Extreme 60 Original when compared to two sets of the same amount of training without supplementation."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"When used in conjunction with an exercise program. As with any food product, use of this product alone will not lead to increased muscle mass or strength.\nPer 3 scoop serving.\t\n"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"1 set+ Amplified Wheybolic Extreme 60 Original= 2 sets! \nSupplement + 1 set\n2 sets without supplement\nIn an eight week, randomized, double-blind, placebo-controlled study of 30 healthy male volunteers comparing 1 set resistance training (RT) + active or carbohydrate placebo to 2 sets RT alone with no supplement, the active group showed equal gains in maximal muscle strength (MMS) and muscle endurance (ME) compared to the control group."},{"type":"FDA Disclaimer Statement","notes":"These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Natural flavors & sweeteners"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"- Formulated exclusively with Whey Protein Isolate & Hydrolysates"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"- Fuels a 30% increase in muscle strength\n- Increases strenght & stamina with half the sets\n"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"60g Protein\n15g BCAA\n3g Sugar\n7.7g Leucine"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Clinically researched"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Natural flavors"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Naturally sweetened with Stevia"},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"Banned Substance Free"},{"type":"FDA Statement of Identity","notes":"Dietary Supplement"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"AMP"},{"type":"General: Product/Version Code","notes":"CODE 386524 IRG"},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"Directions: As a dietary supplement, consume 1-3 scoops of GNC Pro Performance AMP Amplified Wheybolic Extreme 60 Original in 4, 2 or 12 fl oz of cold water respectively, before and/or after exercise. This product can also be consumed first thing in the morning and/or between meals. For extreme results, consume the full 3 scoop serving twice per day in conjunction with your exercise program."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Servings per container 42 21 14"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Contains: Milk and soybeans."},{"type":"Precautions re: Allergies","notes":"Contains: Milk & soybeans."},{"type":"Precautions re: Pregnant or Nursing or Prescription Medications","notes":"Warning: Consult your physician prior to using this product if you are pregnant, nursing, taking medication, or have a medical condition."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Discontinue use two weeks prior to surgery."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Notice: Use this product as a food supplement only. Do not use for weight reduction."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Significant product settling may occur.\n"},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"Gf Gluten Free"},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"Gluten free."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Typical amounts of key amino acids per 3 scoop serving to support optimal muscle growth and development\n15g of BCAA\nLeucine\nIsoleucine\nValine\n45g of muscle supporting amino acids\nGlutamic Acid & Glutamine\nAspartic Acid\nLysine\nThreonine\nArginine\nProline\nSerine\nAlanine\nPhenylalanine\nTyrosine\nCystine\nMethionine\nTryptophan\nGlycine\nHistidine"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"What is Amplified Wheybolic Extreme 60 Original? \nLooking for a protein that will help AMPlify your game? When it comes to enhancing your strength, size and stamina, nothing complements your training regimen like Amplified Wheybolic Extreme 60 Original!"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"It is GNC’s top protein formula with a base of whey and leucine - proven in clinical studies to give you 30% increase in strength, increased muscle size, and 100% improvement in exercise efficiency. That’s better fuel for a stronger body - premium protein for advanced muscle performance."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"The Amplified Wheybolic 60 Extreme Original Evolution \nHow is this protein AMPlified? GNC’s scientists worked with leading exercise and sports nutrition experts and went beyond the extreme to develop this distinct product…"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Highly Effective Whey-Leucine Base – The impressive 60 grams of protein are made entirely from two of the highest quality, fast-absorbing forms of whey protein - isolates and hydrolysates. With 7.7 grams of leucine, this creates an ideal environment for muscle protein synthesis. This potent blend upregulates multiple Genetic Signaling Pathways (GSP) to enhance anabolism and muscle performance. In fact, the whey and leucine blend in Amplified Wheybolic Extreme 60 has been shown to increase muscle strength and stamina with half the sets."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Micronized Amino Acids – Using MicroSorb Amino Technology, the amino acids added to this formula are pulverized, or micronized, from large molecules into smaller particles to facilitate faster absorption.\n"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Why is that important? Better absorption of amino acids means better muscle fuel. These key amino acids support muscle building and recovery."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"More Key Aminos – In addition to a whopping 7.7 grams of Leucine, this formula is loaded with an array of aminos necessary for your muscles. This complex blend of amino acids delivers 3.4 grams of Arginine, which is involved in creatine synthesis, and 9.6 grams of Glutamic Acid & Glutamine supporting anabolic effects. The amino acid L-Carnitine is included to help transform fatty acids into energy for muscles and the body’s energy production system."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"We've made an already great product perfect?\nHow? By using natural flavors and sweeteners. This advanced formula will provide your body with the pure, clean, high-quality protein you need to fuel muscles while maximizing your gains."},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"Informed-choice.org\nTrusted by sport"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Products bearing this logo have been tested for banned substances by LGC Science, Inc., a world-class anti-doping lab. Product was tested for over 145 banned substances on the 2016 World Anti-Doping Agency (WADA) Prohibited List via LGC skip lot testing protocol #ICP0307. See gnc.com for more information."},{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"Keep out of reach of children."},{"type":"Storage","notes":"Store in a cool, dry place."}],"targetGroups":["Adult (18 - 50 Years)","Gluten Free"],"thumbnail":"","upcSku":"0 48107 17007 3","userGroups":[{"dailyValueTargetGroupName":"Adults and children 4 or more years of age","langualCode":"P0250","langualCodeDescription":"Adults and Children 4 years and above"}],"_source":"api"}